## 2. Six design principles (the backbone of the "thinking")

1. **Detection broad, actions narrow.**
   The heartbeat layer only *detects and reports* — it holds no mutation handle on the twin. The RCA layer reads the live twin **read-only** and experiments **only in sandbox copies**. Nothing in the whole project can change a real network. Fault injection is a test harness, gated behind an explicit `--allow-writes` for the real-lab (EVE-NG) path.

2. **Seam-first (mock → real).**
   Every interface's docstring names the real backend it maps to (EVE-NG REST, junos-mcp-server over NETCONF/YANG/OpenConfig, gNMI streaming, Batfish/pybatfish, MCP tool servers, LangGraph orchestration, NautilusTrader). Missing dependency or unreachable endpoint ⇒ **silent fall back to a recorded fixture** plus one `[INFO]` line. The swap from mock to real is implementing an ABC, never editing detection/RCA/eval code.

3. **Causal discipline (cause vs effect).**
   A congested link is an **effect**, never a cause on its own. A candidate root cause must satisfy three tests: (a) it is an **injectable fault type**; (b) it is **temporally aligned** — its timestamp is at or before the symptom onset; (c) **counterfactual replay reproduces the incident's symptom signature**. Only then is it concluded.

4. **Prediction = intent for the closed loop.**
   A forecast does not produce a "number"; it produces an `Incident(source="prediction")` that enters the **same** pipeline the heartbeat feeds. The temporal dimension comes **entirely** from the time-series forecaster; the performance model is a **steady-state map with no time axis**.

5. **Honest evaluation.**
   Ranking is on **MASE** (point) and **CRPS** (probabilistic), **never** MAPE. No superiority claim appears without an accompanying **Diebold–Mariano p-value**. Coverage is **always** reported next to sharpness. Every figure is regenerated from a **frozen tidy table**, never by re-running models. The report **auto-populates a "limits" section** (under-coverage, non-uniform PIT, excluded MAPE points, unavailable models).

6. **Determinism.**
   Virtual clock + fixed seeds + deterministic tie-breaks ⇒ two runs produce **byte-identical** traces and `results.json`. Every number is reproducible from a manifest (seed, config, data window, model availability).

